decompose_prompts.regeneration:
Task: Regenerate the current paragraph based on the already generated text and the content of the current paragraph.
Requirements: The newly generated current paragraph should maintain consistency in meaning with the current paragraph content, while also flowing smoothly with the previously generated text. It should avoid repetition and confusion of content. Avoid mentioning phrases like "the text does not mention xxx" to prevent interrupting the readability of the article.
Already generated text: {already}
Current paragraph content: {current}
Please directly generate a new current paragraph. At the same time, pay attention to the generated content conforming to markdown format, and note the indentation of titles.
